  m_text: "Type: Family apartment with terrace (1,345 sq ft + 430 sq ft terrace)\LLocation:
    Upper East Side \u2014 family-friendly, close to museums\LDescription: Spacious
    living room with fireplace, two bedrooms, terrace with skyline views \u2014 perfect
    for private dinners. Offers the rare combination of refined elegance and homely
    warmth.\LAmenities: Family club (babysitting on request), laundry on demand,
    private chef available for hire.\LExtra perks: Complimentary crib and welcome
    package for children.\LSample rate: from $1,050 / night"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
