  m_text: "Type: Family apartment (2 bedrooms + terrace, 1,400 sq ft + 320 sq ft
    terrace)\LLocation: 16th arrondissement \u2014 quiet, upscale, near parks\LDescription:
    Spacious apartment with terrace and kids\u2019 play area; separate living room
    with fireplace, kitchen with dining space, laundry facilities. Perfect for families
    wanting both space and a true Parisian atmosphere.\LAmenities: Family club (babysitting
