  m_text: " Type: 2-bedroom apartment (1,350 sq ft + 350 sq ft terrace)\L Location:
    Urubamba \u2014 peaceful setting in the Sacred Valley, ideal for families\L Description:
    Spacious apartment with a large terrace overlooking the valley, a warm living
    room with traditional Peruvian artwork, two bedrooms with king-size beds, and
    a fully equipped kitchen. Perfect for families or groups who want to explore
    the region in comfort and style.\L Amenities: Babysitting services on request,
    private chef specializing in Andean cuisine, laundry and ironing service.\L Extra
    perks: Complimentary welcome gift basket with local delicacies and artisan crafts.\L
    Sample rate: from $850 / night\n"
