    workspace. A sophisticated base where business efficiency meets effortless comfort.\LAmenities:
    High-speed business Wi-Fi, personal concierge, executive lounge with 24/7 coffee
    & snacks, private meeting room access.\LExtra perks: \u201CWork & Relax\u201D
    package \u2014 complimentary late checkout until 4:00 PM and two items of clothing
    pressed at no charge.\LSample rate: from $650 / night"
