  m_text: " Type: 2-bedroom penthouse (1,650 sq ft + 400 sq ft terrace)\L Location:
    Aguas Calientes \u2014 panoramic views of Machu Picchu and the Urubamba River\L
    Description: This exclusive penthouse features floor-to-ceiling windows framing
    breathtaking Andean landscapes, an expansive terrace perfect for sunset dinners,
    a spacious living room with local artisan d\xE9cor, and a gourmet kitchen equipped
    with top-tier appliances. Ideal for travelers wanting to combine luxury with
    nature\u2019s majesty.\L Amenities: 24/7 personal concierge, in-suite spa services
    using native Peruvian products, guided tours of Machu Picchu included, airport
    limousine transfers.\L Extra perks: Complimentary traditional Peruvian welcome
    ceremony and a private Andean cooking class for stays of 4+ nights.\L Sample
    rate: from $1,200 / night"
